## TRIPS

### GET all trips, using authorization !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
GET {{base_url}}/trip HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### GET trip by user ID, using authorization !!!!!!!!!!!!!!
GET {{base_url}}/trip/user/4 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### GET a trip by ID !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
GET {{base_url}}/trip/3 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### POST a trip, using authorization !!!!!!!!!!!!!!
POST {{base_url}}/trip HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
    "tripDescription": "test description",
    "tripStartDate": "2023-09-15",
    "tripEndDate": "2023-09-20",
    "transportation": "bus",
    "tripPriority": 3,
    "tripDidIt": false,
    "userId": 1,
    "pin": {
        "pinDescription": "Test!",
        "pinDate": "2022-10-31",
        "pinPriority": 1,
        "pinDidIt": false,
        "city": {
            "cityId": 1630035577,
            "cityName": "San Juan",
            "stateAbr": "PR",
            "stateName": "Puerto Rico",
            "cityLatitude": "18.3985",
            "cityLongitude": "-66.0610"
        },
        "type": {
            "typeId": 26,
            "typeName": "ski"
        }
    }
}

### PUT a trip, using authorization !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
PUT {{base_url}}/trip/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
    "tripId": 1,
    "tripDescription": "updated description",
    "tripPriority": 2,
    "tripStartDate": "2023-10-15",
    "tripEndDate": "2023-10-20"
}

### DELETE a trip, using authorization !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
DELETE {{base_url}}/trip/4 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}





## TYPES

### GET all types !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
GET {{base_url}}/type HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### GET a type by ID !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
GET {{base_url}}/type/3 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### GET a type by userID
GET {{{base_url}}/type/6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### POST a type, using authorization
POST {{base_url}}/type HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
    "typeId": 35,
    "typeName": "paddle board"
}

### PUT a type, using authorization !!!!!!!!!!!!!!
PUT {{base_url}}/type/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
    "typeId": 1,
    "typeName": "sky dive"
}

### DELETE a type (only for admin)
DELETE {{base_url}}/type/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}